stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> RECEIVED
  RECEIVED --> VALIDATED
  RECEIVED --> REJECTED
  VALIDATED --> READY
  READY --> EXECUTING: fresh authority lease fence
  READY --> CANCELLED: durable cancel before effect
  READY --> REJECTED: stale or revoked authority
  EXECUTING --> SUCCEEDED: effect reconciled
  EXECUTING --> FAILED_NO_EFFECT: proven no effect
  EXECUTING --> UNKNOWN: result ambiguous
  EXECUTING --> CANCEL_REQUESTED: cancellation after dispatch
  UNKNOWN --> RECONCILING
  CANCEL_REQUESTED --> RECONCILING
  RECONCILING --> SUCCEEDED: effect exists
  RECONCILING --> FAILED_NO_EFFECT: proven absent
  RECONCILING --> CANCELLED: absent and tombstone
  RECONCILING --> MANUAL_REVIEW: insufficient evidence
  MANUAL_REVIEW --> RECONCILING: new evidence
  FAILED_NO_EFFECT --> VALIDATED: retry allowed same effect key
  SUCCEEDED --> [*]
  CANCELLED --> [*]
  REJECTED --> [*]
